{
  "comment": "Shape of a gnmic ONCE subscription against vJunos-router 25.4R1.12 (PROTO). Values removed; paths are absolute with wildcard keys; see context/gnmi-vendor-sources.md. init-time and state/high-speed are marked always: the capture showed them under the counters subscription although the path does not cover them.",
